Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.65,0:02:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这里只有一只\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}There's only one here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.83,0:02:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,它们是锻造成一对的\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}They were forged as a pair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.50,0:02:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,继续找 一定埋在别的地方\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We'll keep looking for it. It must be buried elsewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.37,0:02:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,别的地方?\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Elsewhere?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.75,0:02:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Like where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.15,0:02:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,(欢迎来到泽西市)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.50,0:02:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,卡玛拉 你在写作业吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Kamala! Are you doing your homework, beta?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.97,0:02:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,对 科学作业\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yeah! Science!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.30,0:03:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,砰\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Boom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.68,0:03:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,卡玛拉·克汗登场\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Enter, Kamala Khan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.68,0:03:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,准备\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Ready for...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.30,0:03:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,惊奇队长\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Captain Marvel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.80,0:03:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,她需要我帮忙\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}She needs my help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.68,0:03:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,看我大展身手\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Shine on, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.68,0:03:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,手怎么这么难画啦\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Why are hands so hard to draw?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.76,0:03:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,惊奇少女及时抵达\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Okay, Ms. Marvel arrives, and just in time...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.25,0:03:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.30,0:03:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.05,0:03:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,复仇者联盟也需要支援\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}...'cause even the Avengers need backup, ya know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.80,0:03:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,轰 卡啪\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Wham! Kapow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.93,0:03:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我的机会来了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}This is my chance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.18,0:03:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,啪\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Pow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.85,0:03:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,砰\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Boom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.51,0:03:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不错嘛 小鬼\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Not bad, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.55,0:03:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.76,0:03:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,惊奇少女\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Ms. Marvel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.10,0:03:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,妹子\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Dude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.35,0:03:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,同名姐妹\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Twinsies!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.60,0:03:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,(同名姐妹)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.93,0:03:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,想参加复仇者联盟的派对吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Hey, you wanna go party with the Avengers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.89,0:03:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,想啊\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Uh... Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.80,0:03:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你会飞吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Can you fly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.05,0:03:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不会 但我会这招\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}No, but I can do this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.18,0:04:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,卡玛拉 别逼我上去哦\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Kamala! Don't make me come up there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.85,0:04:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-听起来不像科学作业 -好啦\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-That does not sound like science to me. -Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.05,0:04:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,(当天稍早)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.30,0:04:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么都不记得吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You don't remember anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.05,0:04:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I see...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.10,0:04:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,一些片段\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}flashes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.43,0:04:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,短暂的时刻\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Little moments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.01,0:04:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我能拼凑那天早上的记忆\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}If I could just piece together what happened that morning...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.22,0:04:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,或许就能厘清真相\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}maybe it'll all make sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.43,0:04:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你们从我家 我家人朋友手中抢走我\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You stole me from my home, my family, my friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.85,0:04:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,小麻烦中尉\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Lieutenant Trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.68,0:05:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-更高 更远 更快 -没错\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Higher, further, faster, baby. -That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.68,0:05:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉至高智慧我会让它划下终点\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Tell the Supreme Intelligence that I'm coming to end it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.89,0:05:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,战争 谎言\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}The war, the lies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.64,0:05:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,全部\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}All of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.93,0:05:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能这么做\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You can't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.30,0:05:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我一转眼就回来了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I'll be back before you know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.64,0:05:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我能飞上天 在半途中见你\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I could fly up and meet you halfway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.43,0:05:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,等你学会跟卡萝阿姨一样发光\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Only if you learn to glow like your Auntie Carol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.60,0:05:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,(路易斯安那州居民飞上天际)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.90,0:05:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,过来 呆头鹅\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Come here, Goosey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.35,0:05:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克·福瑞来电\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Incoming call from Nick Fury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.01,0:05:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你在等电话吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You expecting a call?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.93,0:05:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们转到语音信箱好了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Maybe we just send it to voice mail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.76,0:06:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克·福瑞\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Nick Fury...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.23,0:06:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我最喜欢的独眼特务\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}my favorite one-eyed man of intrigue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.85,0:06:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,卡萝·丹佛斯\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Carol Danvers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.05,0:06:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,银河浪女\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Prodigal child of the Milky Way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.20,0:06:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那边情况如何\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}How goes it out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.43,0:06:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好得很\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Thriving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.17,0:06:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,什么东西\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}What the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.10,0:06:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-呆头鹅吗  -对\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Goose? -Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.14,0:06:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}What about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.20,0:06:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你好吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}How are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.35,0:06:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道几小时前跳跃点系统有突波吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}What do you know about the surge in the jump point system a few hours ago?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.52,0:06:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我没注意到异常现象\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I didn't notice anything unusual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.97,0:06:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我来看看\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I'll take a look now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.39,0:06:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,干扰到整个系统\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It rattled the whole system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.70,0:06:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在了解来龙去脉\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We're trying to get a handle on what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.45,0:06:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,整个网络都受影响\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}The entire network was affected?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.90,0:06:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,对 从头到尾\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yeah. End to end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.14,0:06:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好我们的神经网络团队\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Thankfully, our neural network team...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.72,0:06:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,追踪源头到MB-418\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}was able to trace the origin back to MB-418.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.52,0:06:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-你在那附近吧 -对\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-You're in the neighborhood, right? -Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.01,0:06:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你能查查看吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Can you check it out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.97,0:06:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-马上办 -感谢\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-I'm on it. -Appreciate you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.01,0:06:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,莫妮卡的团队收到情报就会立刻传达\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Monica and her team will send more intel as they acquire it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.05,0:06:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,莫妮卡\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Monica?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.80,0:06:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,她在那边干嘛 我以为她在地球\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}What's she doing there? I thought that she was on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.98,0:06:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-她还好吗 -还好\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Is she okay? -Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.38,0:06:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,她不是你印象中的小女生了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}And she's not that little kid you remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.36,0:07:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能在晚餐前完成吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}So, do we think that we can finish this before dinner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.80,0:07:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该来不及修好\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yeah. I don't think we're gonna fix it in time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.35,0:07:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,取得跳跃点的读数\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}to get a reading on the jump point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.97,0:07:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道某人的超能力有办法\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}But I do know someone with superpowers who could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.85,0:07:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.06,0:07:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我去\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Fine. I'll go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.02,0:07:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你们进去看看网络的状态\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You guys head in and check the status of the network.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.55,0:07:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,查出受损情形才能修复\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We've gotta find this damage and see if we can reverse it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.56,0:07:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是 上尉\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Aye, aye, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.77,0:08:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,福瑞\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Fury...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.81,0:08:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我查到了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I think I found something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.98,0:08:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,通讯改为手控\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Communications override.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.27,0:08:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝博上尉 太空船外\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Captain Rambeau. Spacewalk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.18,0:08:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,已连线\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Connected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.10,0:08:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝博\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Rambeau...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.10,0:08:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}what the hell are you doin'?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.56,0:08:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,突波似乎在跳跃点留下残余效应\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Seems the surge has had some residual effect on the jump point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.73,0:08:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我传读数给你 福瑞\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I'm gonna get you some readings, Fury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.48,0:08:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,莫...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Mon...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.52,0:08:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-喂  -莫妮卡\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Hello? -Monica.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.27,0:08:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.81,0:08:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那是莫妮卡吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Was that Monica?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.60,0:08:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-卡萝阿姨 -福瑞\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Aunt Carol? -Fury...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.81,0:08:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-那是莫妮卡吗 -想跟她讲话吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-was that Monica? -Why, you wanna talk to her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.60,0:08:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在的状况\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I don't think I'm in the best...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.64,0:08:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不太适合 我不...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}position to... I... I don't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.52,0:08:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I don't wanna...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.93,0:08:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,听着...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Look...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.93,0:08:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想这样跟她讲话\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I don't wanna talk to her like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.35,0:08:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-都过了这么久 -其实...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Not after all this time. -You know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.56,0:08:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-你终究得和她说话 -我知道\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-eventually you're gonna have to talk to her. -I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.06,0:08:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 可是...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I know, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.18,0:08:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,等我回到里面再跟家人团聚\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}let's save the family reunions till I'm back inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.06,0:09:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我发现突波的来源了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I think I found the source of the surge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.48,0:09:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到什么\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}What are you seeing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.02,0:09:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,它是个跳跃点 但没有关闭 好像...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It's a jump point, but it's not closing. Like...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.48,0:09:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,卡住了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}it's stuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.89,0:09:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,丹佛斯\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Danvers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.93,0:09:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,丹佛斯\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Danvers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.14,0:09:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,丹佛斯\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Danvers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.35,0:09:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,跳跃点仍在渗漏能量\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}The jump point's still leaking energy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.48,0:09:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-上尉 喂 -喂\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Captain Rambeau? -Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.89,0:09:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-喂 -莫妮卡\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Hello? -Monica.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.89,0:09:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好美\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.10,0:10:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Oh, my God, oh, my God, oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.64,0:10:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,别转了 拜托\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Stop spinning, stop spinning, stop spinning, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.64,0:10:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是尼克·福瑞 嗨\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It's Nick Fury! Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.48,0:10:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}How did you... Oh, wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.85,0:10:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我是卡玛拉·克汗 不 我是惊奇少女\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I'm Kamala Khan. No, sorry, I'm Ms. Marvel, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.23,0:10:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,来自泽西市\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}But I'm from Jersey City and I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.64,0:11:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕 我没戴招牌面罩\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Oh, no, I don't have my mask on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.93,0:11:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这是复仇者联盟测验吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Is this an Avengers test?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.64,0:11:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你究竟是谁\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Who the hell are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.85,0:11:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,(惊奇队长  赞)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.80,0:11:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,(永远的好朋友)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.39,0:11:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.06,0:11:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好漂亮的客厅\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Really good living room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.35,0:11:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-卡玛拉 -卡玛拉\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Kamala? -Kamala?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.23,0:11:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你们对我做了什么\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}What did you do to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.52,0:11:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-达本想干嘛 -太迟了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-What is Dar-Benn doing? -It's too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.85,0:11:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,至高者已经在塔奈星上了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}The Supremor's already on Tarnax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.98,0:12:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你阻止不了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You can't stop this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.77,0:12:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,等着瞧\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Watch me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.32,0:12:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,福瑞 是克里人\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Fury. It's the Kree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.28,0:12:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要攻击塔奈星上的史克鲁尔人\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}They're going after the Skrulls on Tarnax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.23,0:12:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 别冲动\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Now, hold on. Do not go in swinging.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.61,0:12:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-这是一趟和平与和解之旅 -福瑞\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-This is a peace and reconciliation tour. -Fury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.11,0:12:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-我来处理 -卡萝...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-I got this. -Carol...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.73,0:12:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟叫卡玛拉·克汗的人交换位置\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}So, I switched with someone named Kamala Khan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.28,0:12:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,对 她好像跟你一样糊涂\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yeah. She seemed to be as confused as you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.48,0:12:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,她的超能力不包含瞬间移动\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Well, there's nothing in her power-set about teleportation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.69,0:12:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,别再聊她了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Enough about her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.82,0:12:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我想知道你在MB-418上的遭遇\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I wanna know what happened to you on MB-418.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.57,0:12:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.28,0:12:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我得先说我不太确定 不过...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Let me preface this by saying I'm not really sure. But...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.86,0:12:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我没弄坏衣柜门 我在太空上\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I did not break my closet door, okay? I was in space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.07,0:12:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-它自己坏的 -不是 我消失了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Oh, so it broke itself? -No, no, no. See, I disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.73,0:12:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定是惊奇队长弄坏的\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}So maybe Captain Marvel broke it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.03,0:12:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么 -对 你朋友惊奇队长\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-What? -Yes, your friend, Captain Marvel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.40,0:13:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,她在我们客厅走来走去\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}She was walking up and down our living room...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.48,0:13:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你回家\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}and now you come back...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.65,0:13:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,飘进来却没道歉\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}waltzing in with no apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.23,0:13:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,惊奇队长来我们家?\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I'm sorry, Captain Marvel was in our house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.57,0:13:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,惊奇队长有对你施压吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Is Captain Marvel pressuring you in any way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.82,0:13:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白她是个大人物\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Look, I understand that she's an important figure and all that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.23,0:13:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但你不必对她言听计从\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}but you don't have to do as she says.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.57,0:13:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不 她们根本是一起合作\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}No, no, they're clearly working together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.86,0:13:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-看她笑成那样 -闭嘴\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Look at her face. Look at her smile. -Aamir, stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.53,0:13:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-她又在搞神秘 -别找你妹的碴\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-She's being super secretive as always. -Aamir, stop picking on your sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.78,0:13:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-看看她 -穆妮芭\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Look at her. -Muneeba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.98,0:13:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,卡玛拉 你又在说谎了吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Kamala, are you lying again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.61,0:13:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-跟我说你是否 -我女儿没说谎\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Just tell me if you're involved or... -My daughter has said she's not lying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.69,0:13:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-卡玛拉 -她明明...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Kamala. -Looks like she's having...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.86,0:13:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-很开心 -穆妮芭\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-so much fun. -Muneeba...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.03,0:13:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-她不会保密 -天啊 是真的\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-She's bad at keeping secrets. -Oh, my God! It's happening!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.65,0:13:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,接近塔奈星\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Approaching Tarnax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.23,0:13:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,警告\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Warning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.40,0:13:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,侦测到克里人船舰\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Kree ship detected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.80,0:14:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,(塔奈星 史克鲁尔难民移居地)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.61,0:14:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是我们说好的 达本\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}This is not what we agreed, Dar-Benn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.86,0:14:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,至高者达本\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Supremor Dar-Benn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.23,0:14:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,史克鲁尔人\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}The Skrull...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.36,0:14:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,已经散落在宇宙各角落\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}have been scattered to every corner of the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.73,0:14:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,到哪里都成为难民 不过...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Made refugees wherever we go, and still...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.44,0:14:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还是抱持诚恳态度进行谈判\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}we came into these negotiations in good faith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.86,0:14:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我了解 卓治\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I hear you, Dro'ge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.19,0:14:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我或许比任何人更了解你们吃的苦\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I, perhaps more than anyone, understand what you and your people have been through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.69,0:15:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,在我的前任垮台后\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}After my predecessor was destroyed...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.69,0:15:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,异端分子填补空缺\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}heretics rose up to fill the void.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.82,0:15:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,内战污染了天空 我们族人无法呼吸\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}The Civil War has polluted our skies. My people cannot breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.07,0:15:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的太阳奄奄一息\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Our sun is dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.98,0:15:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,哈拉星时序紊乱\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Hala is out of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.75,0:15:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望我们能一起重建\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I hope we can rebuild together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.28,0:15:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我甚至愿意放下祖先的仇恨\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}So much so that I'm willing to put our ancient animosities behind us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.80,0:15:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,给你们机会保护族人\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}And give you a chance to protect your people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.82,0:15:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不再逃亡\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}To stop running.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.98,0:15:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,史克鲁尔人将在克里帝国占一席之地\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}The Skrull will take their rightful place in the Kree Empire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.23,0:15:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我将协助他们迁移\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}And I will aid in their relocation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.48,0:15:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-迁移 -什么意思\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Relocation? -What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.19,0:15:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不愿剥夺大气层 让你们受苦\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I would hate for your people to suffocate when I strip the atmosphere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.01,0:16:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是歼灭者\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It's the Annihilator!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.93,0:16:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.72,0:16:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-怎么回事 -对啊 怎么回事\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-What the hell is going on? -Yes, what the hell is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.68,0:16:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我在一艘太空船上 然后就瞬移过来\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I was on some freaky spaceship and then I teleported here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.68,0:16:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不知是不是我的新能力\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I don't know if that's my new power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.80,0:16:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-这只怪猫吃了一个人 -猫会吃人\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-And then this freaking cat ate a man. -How can a cat eat a man, Kamala?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.09,0:16:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 它有触手\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I don't know. It has tentacles...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.18,0:16:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-吃了一个人 -什么触手\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-and it ate a man. -What tentacles, Kamala?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.30,0:16:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-不知道 -触手在哪\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-I don't know. -Where are the tentacles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.38,0:16:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,从它嘴巴冒出来\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It comes out of his mouth, and they're...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.68,0:16:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-天啊 -噢\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Oh, my God! -Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.97,0:16:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 又来了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Oh, my God, it's happening again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.68,0:17:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-不 -卡玛拉 他们是谁\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Oh, no, no, no. -Kamala, who are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.01,0:17:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Please run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.26,0:17:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么来的 又怎么扯进来\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}How did you get here, and how're you involved in this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.76,0:17:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,克里人在MB-418弄了个虫洞\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}The Kree jury-rigged a wormhole on MB-418.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.55,0:17:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,像跳跃点\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You mean like a jump point?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.38,0:17:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-不知道 我碰了一下 -为什么\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-I don't know. But I touched it and then I... -Why'd you do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.13,0:17:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,它在发光又很神秘\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Because it was glowing and mysterious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.80,0:17:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,新规定 不准乱碰\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Okay, new rule, no more touching shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.97,0:17:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是发光的神秘物体\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Especially glowing, mysterious shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.30,0:17:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我感受到你满满的负能量\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Okay, I'm feeling a lot of negative energy from you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.97,0:17:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢 那不是重点\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}and I don't like it. That's not the point. The point is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.09,0:17:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,重点是它抽走大气 还这样\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}is that it was siphoning off the atmosphere. And it did this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.34,0:17:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,剪刀赢布\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Scissors beat paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.84,0:17:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,福瑞 有能量绕着我的手转 专心\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Fury! There was, like, energy that went around my hand. Focus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.59,0:17:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好 不然我这样\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Okay, maybe if I do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.01,0:17:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,歼灭者\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Annihilator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.13,0:17:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢这名字\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I don't like that name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.47,0:18:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-你朋友 -你好\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Friends of yours? -Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.80,0:18:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,歼灭者\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Annihilator!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.47,0:19:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,歼灭者\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Annihilator!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.63,0:19:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,阿米尔 压住他\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Aamir, get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.51,0:19:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,压住他\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Get him! Hit him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.51,0:20:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,优素福\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yusuf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.47,0:20:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Let me go! Let me go! Let me go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.88,0:20:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,卡玛拉 你还好吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Kamala, are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.93,0:20:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,福瑞\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Fury!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.30,0:20:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我只要传递辐射 就会瞬间移动\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I think I'm getting teleported whenever I channel any kind of radiant...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.09,0:20:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我使用超能力就会转换位置\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I think I switch when I use my powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.88,0:20:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,很有可能\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Strong theory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.05,0:20:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,很有可能\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Strong theory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.45,0:21:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的测试不断产生相同结果\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Our tests keep generating the same result.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.53,0:21:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,只要有新的跳跃点 这手环就更不稳\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}With each new jump point, this band becomes more unstable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.80,0:21:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我强烈建议等待第二只手环\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I strongly suggest we wait for the second band.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.22,0:22:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,又见面了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Hi, again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.30,0:22:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,之前的事很抱歉\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}So sorry about earlier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.40,0:22:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们找卡玛拉·克汗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We're looking for Kamala Khan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.90,0:22:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我入选了吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Did I get in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.20,0:22:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,新苹果平板 没看过\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Is this the new iPad? I haven't seen it yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.28,0:22:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他们哪比得上\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}They wish!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.28,0:22:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-走了 -就是啊\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-All right. Come on, let's go. -I know. Wait...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.30,0:22:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,最高机密情报怎么是透明的\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}if this is all top secret information, why is it on a clear case?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.32,0:22:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,因为...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.53,0:22:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,滑一下就好 嗨\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}just... swipe it a little bit... Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.15,0:22:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,相信吗 他们有我的资料\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Can you believe it? They have intel on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.00,0:22:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是我耶\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}On me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.85,0:22:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我的资料耶\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I am intel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.80,0:22:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧你\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Look at you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.00,0:22:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,神刃代表什么\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Hey, what does S.A.B.E.R. stand for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.10,0:22:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,策略航太生物物理\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Strategic Aerospace Biophysics...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.30,0:22:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-与外星语言回应 -这是机密\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-and Exolinguistic Response. -That's classified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.10,0:22:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.90,0:22:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,"硬光超能力" 有\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}"Hard Light powers," yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.94,0:22:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-诺尔 -你们为何有她的资料\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-"Noor..." -Okay, but why do you have intel on her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.44,0:22:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在监视我们吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Is there some sort of surveillance on us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.10,0:22:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-说监视太严重了 -女士\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-"Surveillance" is a strong word. -Well, ma'am...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.60,0:22:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你女儿是拯救泽西市的英雄\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}your daughter is the hero that saved Jersey City.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.60,0:22:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们当然有她的资料\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}So, of course we would have intel on someone like her. And you're also...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.50,0:22:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-你也经过电磁异变 -什么意思\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-electromagnetically altered. -What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.65,0:23:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,意思是我们俩都有\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Oh, it just means that we both have...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.40,0:23:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,光基超能力\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}light-based powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.03,0:23:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你的代号是什么\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}What's your code name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.78,0:23:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有代号\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Oh, I don't have a code name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.30,0:23:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们再讨论 -不了 谢谢\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-We'll workshop it. -No, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.45,0:23:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,卡萝阿姨\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Aunt Carol...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.60,0:23:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,惊奇队长也有光基超能力\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Captain Marvel also has light-based powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.40,0:23:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,应该不是巧合\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It's probably not a coincidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,更别提你们俩直接碰到\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Not to mention the two of you came into direct contact...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.00,0:23:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,一些失灵的跳跃点\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}with some malfunctioning jump points.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.90,0:23:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不敢相信惊奇队长来过 我却没见到\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I still cannot believe that Captain Marvel was here and I didn't even get to meet her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.20,0:23:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是同名姐妹哦\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You know, we're supposed to be all, like "twinsies!" you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.80,0:23:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,名字相同 我一定会...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We have the same name. I would obviously, then...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.60,0:23:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我会把我写的信交给她\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I don't know, I would just give her the letter I wrote for her...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.03,0:23:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,跟她出去吃饭 然后...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}and we would go out for lunch, and then it would just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.30,0:23:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你说"卡萝阿姨"\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Did you say "Aunt Carol?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.00,0:23:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我说惊奇队长\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I said that Captain Marvel...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.50,0:23:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,能吸收光能\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}can absorb light energy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.30,0:23:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我看得见\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I can see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.70,0:23:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你能把光\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}And you, you can turn light...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.10,0:23:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,变成实体\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}into physical matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.70,0:23:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这我没听过\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Which I have never heard of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.40,0:23:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-我的假设 -我能秀给你看\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-But my working theory... -I could totally show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.00,0:23:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.57,0:23:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}What the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.76,0:23:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.65,0:24:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.98,0:24:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,她们不像亲戚\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Nah, they don't seem related.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.10,0:24:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,随便 家家有本难念的经\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Whatever, Yusuf. Families are complicated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.69,0:24:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,莫妮卡 要跟卡萝说说你的推论吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Monica, you wanna fill Carol in on your working theory?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.98,0:24:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.19,0:24:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 惊奇队长\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Hi, Captain Marvel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.40,0:24:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 小麻烦中尉\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It is so good to see you, Lieutenant Trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.30,0:24:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.50,0:24:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是蓝博上尉了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}And it's Captain Rambeau now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.45,0:24:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,对 抱歉\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Right. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.55,0:24:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么新消息\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}So, what's new?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.90,0:24:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我妹妹在哪\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Where's my sister?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.61,0:24:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我们都接触到那些不稳的跳跃点\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I'm thinking that our joint exposure to these unsteady jump points...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.03,0:24:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,也容易受电磁能影响\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}and our susceptibility to electromagnetic energy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.10,0:24:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们的世界线短暂缠结\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}has temporarily entangled our world-lines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.40,0:24:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那样\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yeah, that, right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.44,0:24:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,缠结 我们的光能力缠结在一起\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Entanglement. Our light powers are entangled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.40,0:24:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,同时使用它们 我们就会交换位置\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}So, we switch places whenever we use them at the same time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.44,0:24:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-所以卡玛拉... -你何时获得超能力\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Which would mean Kamala... -When did you get powers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.80,0:24:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我走过女巫咒圈的辐射屏蔽障碍\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I walked through a radiation shielding barrier...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.44,0:24:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,现在能操控并看见\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}of a witch hex and now I can manipulate and see...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.78,0:25:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,电磁频谱上的所有波长\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}all wavelengths of the electromagnetic spectrum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.60,0:25:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,真替你开心\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I'm very happy for you. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.10,0:25:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们女儿呢 -拜托 卡玛拉呢\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Where's our daughter? -Yes, please. Where is Kamala?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.90,0:25:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,在你原本的位置\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Wherever you were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.15,0:25:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-你刚刚在哪 -谁是卡玛拉\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Where were you? -Who's Kamala?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.65,0:25:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我们交换位置的第三人\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}The third person we're switching with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.73,0:25:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-光能力少女 你在哪 -你干嘛\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Light powers. Teenage girl. Where were you? -What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.32,0:25:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-你在干嘛 -我想交换位置\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-What are you doing? -I'm trying to switch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.48,0:25:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然没用\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Why isn't it working when I need it to work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.23,0:25:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,丹佛斯\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Danvers, Danvers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.28,0:25:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-好乱 -跟卡玛拉说她老爸很不爽\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-So confused. -Tell Kamala that her Abu is very upset.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.15,0:25:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,要去哪 去干嘛\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Where are we going and why are we going there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.88,0:25:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-卡萝 -卡萝 你要去哪\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Carol! -Carol, where you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.86,0:25:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.82,0:25:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,莫妮卡 你得飞上去\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Monica, you gotta fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.94,0:25:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}No, no, no. I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.32,0:25:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I mean, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.53,0:25:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,严格说来我还没飞过\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}But technically, I haven't done that yet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.19,0:25:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,现在非飞不可\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yeah, well, you got to now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.86,0:25:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,否则卡玛拉高中毕不了业\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}or Kamala's not gonna graduate from high school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.11,0:25:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 用你的核心肌群\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Come on! Use your core!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.15,0:25:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Oh, jeez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.36,0:25:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,黑人女力\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Hey. Black Girl Magic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.36,0:26:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我来了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I got you! I got you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.44,0:26:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我抓住你\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I got you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.86,0:26:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,惨了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Oops!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.23,0:26:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.57,0:26:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么事\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}What is happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.23,0:26:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我飞行时抓不住你\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I can't hold on to you while I'm flying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.94,0:26:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Oh, my God! Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.98,0:26:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们死定了 -抓紧\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-We're gonna die! -Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.53,0:26:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧 我在想办法\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Hold on! I'm thinking, I'm thinking!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.48,0:26:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 我想到了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Wait, I have an idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.73,0:27:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,抱住我\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Grab on to me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.53,0:27:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这样最好有用\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}This had better work!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.94,0:27:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 是卡萝\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Oh, it's cool. It's Carol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.65,0:27:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,别发功\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Okay, no powers, no powers. Just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.19,0:27:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,她们是谁\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Who are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.57,0:27:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,她们是惊奇队长的同伙\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}They are associates of Captain Marvel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.80,0:27:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,歼灭者来了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}The Annihilator is here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.61,0:27:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,来过 然后这两个就出现了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yeah, well, she was. And then these two just sort of appeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.36,0:27:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那只手环呢\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}What about the band?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.65,0:27:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,如果她干预 我现在就得出手\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}If she's meddling, I need to strike now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.32,0:27:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是不懂MB-418为何不稳\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yeah. I still can't account for the instabilities exhibited on MB-418.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.78,0:27:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-这玩意的威力不只... -可是有用\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-This thing does much more than just... -But it works?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.07,0:27:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,对 如果给我更多时间\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yes. Yes. But if you give me more time...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.28,0:27:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-我能让它更安全 -不行\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-I can make it safer. -No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.11,0:27:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就开始\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}No. We do it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.94,0:28:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,趁歼灭者尚未出现\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Before the Annihilator appears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.15,0:28:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这两个该怎么处置\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}What should we do about... these two?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.98,0:28:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.03,0:28:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Hold that thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.90,0:29:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得抢走她的手环\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We gotta get that band off of her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.23,0:29:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,它跟我的好像\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It looks like mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.03,0:29:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Guys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.15,0:29:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会飞\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I can't fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.78,0:29:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,有太空船能借我吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Do you guys have a spaceship I could borrow or...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.57,0:29:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,卡玛拉 别跟他们说话\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Kamala, don't talk to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.15,0:29:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我的名字\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You know my name!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.73,0:29:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,克里人来此 希望\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}The Kree came here hopeful...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.11,0:29:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们能签和平协议 -你做了什么\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-that we could build a covenant of peace. -What have you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.36,0:29:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,结果你们派歼灭者攻击我们\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}But then you sic the Annihilator on us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.90,0:29:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,把我们当成害虫\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Like we're vermin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.19,0:30:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,史克鲁尔人再次背叛克里人\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Once again, the Skrull have betrayed the Kree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.19,0:30:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,因此...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}And for that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.48,0:30:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,卡萝 我们得带这些人离开\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Carol, we gotta get these people out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.86,0:30:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,卓治皇帝\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Emperor Dro'ge...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.28,0:30:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须立刻撤离族人\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}you need to evacuate your people now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.36,0:30:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们无处可去\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We have nowhere to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.78,0:31:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,卡萝 那些船...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Carol, the ships...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.32,0:31:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他们逃不掉的\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}they're not gonna make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.82,0:31:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,回船上 别使用超能力\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Get back to the ship and don't use your powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.90,0:31:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-我能帮忙 -快去\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-But I can help. -Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.40,0:32:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-快走 -卡玛拉呢\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Let's go. -Where's Kamala?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.90,0:32:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,卡玛拉\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Kamala!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.15,0:32:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.53,0:32:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Let's go, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.78,0:32:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-快点 -快进去\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Come on! -Keep moving...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.40,0:32:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}please, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.23,0:33:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-这些人... -快走\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-All these people, they're gonna... -Come on, sweetie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.44,0:33:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-不 怎能丢下他们 -卡玛拉快走\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-No! How can you just leave them here? -Kamala, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.23,0:33:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得救能救的人\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We need to save who we can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.49,0:33:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,讯号已送出\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Transmission sent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.66,0:33:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.99,0:33:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这项和平协议\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}This peace treaty...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.28,0:34:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是好事\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}it was a good thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.58,0:34:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-它是诡计 -如果是...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-It was a ruse. -If it were...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.58,0:34:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你出手干预也失败了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}your intervention failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.16,0:34:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不需要你帮忙了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We don't need your help anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.74,0:34:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我联络上一个朋友\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I called a friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.49,0:34:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,她能为你们找到栖身之所\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}She can find a safe place for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.08,0:34:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Is that okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.12,0:34:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们别无选择\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We have no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.78,0:34:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Incoming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.99,0:34:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.58,0:34:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,再次谢谢你\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Thank you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.24,0:34:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,别客气\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Always.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.78,0:34:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你终于组成了一个团队\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I see that you've finally found yourself a team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.16,0:34:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,无心插柳\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It is unintentional.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.33,0:34:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我自己也加入一个无心插柳团队\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Oh, I've been on some unintentional teams myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.03,0:35:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-我知道 -你不必孤军奋战了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-I know, but... -You can stand tall without standing alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.33,0:35:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 惊奇队长\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Take it from me, Marv.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.91,0:35:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.24,0:35:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,惊奇队长会解决的\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Captain Marvel will fix this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.58,0:35:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.41,0:35:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.99,0:35:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,愿下次欢喜相见\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}May our next meeting be joyful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.35,0:35:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,(哈拉星)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.45,0:36:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,可以呼吸了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.16,0:36:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你们记得吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Do you remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.78,0:36:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,太阳曾经照耀着哈拉星\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}When the sun used to shine on Hala?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.62,0:36:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的家园有多么美丽\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}How beautiful our home was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.78,0:36:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,在她来临之前\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Before her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.28,0:36:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,在歼灭者来临之前\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Before the Annihilator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.24,0:37:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我在场\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I was there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.24,0:37:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我听见她的谎言\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I heard her lies...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.66,0:37:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,宣称她是来解救我们的\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}claiming she was there to set us free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.45,0:37:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,可是当她摧毁至高智慧\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}But when she destroyed the Supreme Intelligence...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.28,0:37:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,也消灭了克里人\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}she destroyed the Kree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.33,0:37:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,30年来我与各位并肩作战\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}For 30 years I have been fighting alongside you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.99,0:37:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我不但带来和平\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Not only have I brought you peace...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.66,0:37:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,也设法让哈拉星重返荣耀\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}but I have found a way to return Hala to glory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.20,0:37:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,至高者\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Supremor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.20,0:37:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,至高者\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Supremor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.62,0:37:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,重燃太阳需要比那手环更强的力量\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We need more power than that band can provide if we're to reignite our sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.20,0:37:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那么多能量\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}That amount of energy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.91,0:37:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,会杀死你\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Well, it would kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.95,0:37:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,如果代价是我的性命 我愿意\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}If my life is the cost, so be it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.68,0:37:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会及时找到另一只\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We will find the other in time, Suprem...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.58,0:37:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,没有时间了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}There is no more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.08,0:38:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,哈拉星没时间了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Hala is out of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.53,0:38:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,需要帮忙吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Need a hand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.33,0:38:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.88,0:38:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,把那激光拿给我 三微米\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Will you hand me that laser? Three micrometres.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.75,0:38:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.33,0:38:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你走过女巫咒圈就能这样\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}So you can do that because you walked through a witch hex?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.92,0:38:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.42,0:38:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,弹指事件后 他们不再派我们上太空\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}When I got blipped back, they weren't sending us to space anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.00,0:39:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,只能调查地球异常现象\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Grounded us to investigate earthbound anomalies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.71,0:39:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那一定不好受\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}That must have been hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.17,0:39:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你妈说你的梦想是上太空\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Your mom told me that you always dreamed of going to space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.46,0:39:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你想证明自己\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}That you had something to prove.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.70,0:39:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你说你一转眼就回来了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You said you'd be back before I knew it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.88,0:39:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.38,0:39:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,当你离开时\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}When you left...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.58,0:39:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你说你一转眼就回来了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}you said you'd be back before I knew it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.96,0:39:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我是认真的 但我不知道\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I meant what I said. I just, I didn't know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.92,0:39:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,自己会陷入什么处境\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}what I was getting myself into.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.75,0:39:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么对一个小女生解释\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I didn't know how to explain to a little girl that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.33,0:39:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,认真看待你每句话的小女生\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}A little girl that hung on your every word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.92,0:39:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你知道\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}If you knew...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.92,0:39:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我原本会回来\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I was going to come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.96,0:39:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,只是...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.96,0:39:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,有些人需要我\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}There was people that needed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.71,0:39:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也需要你 卡萝\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We needed you, Carol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.63,0:40:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.79,0:40:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,希望你不介意 我没别的衣服\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I hope you don't mind. I didn't have any other clothes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.13,0:40:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It's totally fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.96,0:40:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你穿很好看\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Looks good on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.33,0:40:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.21,0:40:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I'm really sorry...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.75,0:40:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我那样跟你说话\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}for the way I spoke to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.75,0:40:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.88,0:40:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这情况不太理想\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I know that this situation isn't ideal...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.67,0:40:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,但其实这样感觉很好\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}but it is actually nice...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.00,0:40:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,船上又有了人气\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}having people on board again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.21,0:40:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里挺寂寞的\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It gets pretty lonely out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.08,0:40:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你要有人陪 我会放下一切\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Anytime you need company, I will be there. I will drop everything. I will...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.79,0:40:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我愿意休学\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I will drop high school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.38,0:40:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不准\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Don't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.63,0:40:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,可以重新开始吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}But can we start again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.54,0:40:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 我是卡萝·丹佛斯\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Hi, I'm Carol Danvers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.00,0:40:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我是卡玛拉·克汗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I am Kamala Khan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.17,0:40:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,可是在泽西市街头打击犯罪时\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}But when I'm fighting crime on the streets of Jersey City...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.50,0:41:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫惊奇少女 希望没侵犯著作权\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I go by Ms. Marvel, and I hope that's okay, like, copyright-wise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.33,0:41:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我打死都没想过会见到你\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Because, honestly, I never thought I'd ever get to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.08,0:41:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,结果就这样 我们有了肢体接触\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}But now that it's happening and we're, like, touching each other...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.17,0:41:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我发现我应该先征求同意\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I've realized I should have asked permission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.88,0:41:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,同名姐妹\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}So, twinsies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.58,0:41:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Okay. All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.50,0:41:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来要这么办\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Here's what we're gonna do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.71,0:41:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-惊奇队长 -别再这样叫我\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Captain Marvel. -You need to stop calling me that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.63,0:41:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-我帮你换过尿布 -才一次\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-I used to change your diapers. -Oh, that was once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.38,0:41:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,听说你吐得到处都是\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}And then I was told you proceeded to vomit everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.29,0:41:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,首先...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}First of all...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.46,0:41:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的船 由我来拟订计划\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}it's my ship, so I make the game plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.25,0:41:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 你最近领导过团队吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Oh, I'm sorry. When's the last time you led a team?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.29,0:41:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,上星期就有\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}As early as last week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.88,0:41:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,呆头鹅不算\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Goose doesn't count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.92,0:41:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你指挥呆头鹅试试看\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Please. You try giving Goose orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.33,0:41:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们变一个团队了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Oh, my God, we're a team?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.58,0:41:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们不是团队 -并不是\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-We're not... We're not a team. -No, no, no, we're not a team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.58,0:41:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我 泽西市的卡玛拉·克汗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I, Kamala Khan of Jersey City...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.21,0:41:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,加入惊奇队长和莫妮卡·蓝博上尉团队\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}am on a team with Captain Marvel and Captain Monica Rambeau...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.54,0:41:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,从现在起就叫作...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}who from this point onwards will now be known as...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.79,0:41:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,惊奇教授\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Professor Marvel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.25,0:41:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-惊奇教授 -不行\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Professor Marvel. -No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.71,0:41:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-不行 不过谢了 -惊奇天团\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-No, no, she, she will not. But thank you. -The Marvels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.29,0:41:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,现在团名搞定了 我一直想告诉你们\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Now that we've got that out of the way, team, I've been trying to tell you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.42,0:41:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道她如何创造奇怪的跳跃点\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I think I know how she's making the weird jump points.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.46,0:42:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,她有这个\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}She has one of these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.33,0:42:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我外婆的手镯\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It's my nani's bangle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.21,0:42:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,达本开启第一个跳跃点时\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It started glowing really weirdly...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.54,0:42:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,它突然开始发光 还有...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}when Dar-Benn opened that first jump point. Also...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.29,0:42:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,它曾经让我穿越时空\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}it once traveled me through space and time...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.25,0:42:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那应该也有关系\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}so that's probably related.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.21,0:42:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的是量子手环\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}What you're describing is a Quantum Band.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.25,0:42:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这手镯有两个\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I mean, I knew there were two of these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.67,0:42:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,却没想到另一个在太空中\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I just did not expect the other one to be in space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.42,0:42:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,它们是一对 你怎么有量子手环\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}They're a pair? How do you have a Quantum Band?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.08,0:42:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,量子手环是什么\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Okay. What is a Quantum Band?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.75,0:42:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,神话之物 我以为是神话\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}A myth. Or I thought it was a myth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.08,0:42:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是一种古文物\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It's an ancient artifact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.17,0:42:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是达本在MB-418上找到的\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}So this is what Dar-Benn found on MB-418.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.54,0:42:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,然后她和卡玛拉刚好碰上\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}And then her and Kamala just happened to stumble into each other?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.48,0:42:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这概率也太低了吧\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I mean, what are the chances?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.17,0:42:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,"你所寻的 也在寻你"\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}"What you seek is seeking you."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.75,0:42:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,就刻在手镯上\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It's inscribed on the bangle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.63,0:42:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,如果克里人的传说是真的\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}If the Kree legends are true...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.75,0:42:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,量子手环就是用来\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}the Quantum Bands were used to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.25,0:42:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,创造宇宙中的每个跳跃点\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}create every jump point in the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.67,0:42:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,瞬间移动网络\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Teleportation network.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.25,0:42:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,两个量子手环合作能连结银河系\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Two Quantum Bands working in unison to connect the galaxy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.21,0:42:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这说明了我们交换缠结的状况\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}So that would explain our switch-y entanglement situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.75,0:42:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,对 但达本只有一个\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yeah, yeah, but Dar-Benn only has one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.79,0:43:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,她一定在上面过载了太空锤的能量\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}She must be overloading it with the energy from her space hammer thingy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.00,0:43:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,它叫万能武器\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It's called the Universal Weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.17,0:43:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗 我本来想叫它宇宙杖\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Oh, really? I was gonna call it Cosmi-Rod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.71,0:43:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,反正她利用它强迫不稳的跳跃点加入\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Either way, she's using it to force unstable jump points into the grid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.25,0:43:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得在她再创造跳跃点前找到她\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We have got to get to her before she makes another one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.25,0:43:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,她船上的屏幕有星图\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}She had star charts and maps on the screens on her ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.67,0:43:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好 前往哪里\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Okay. To where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.67,0:43:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-前往恒星 -好\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-To the stars? -Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.54,0:43:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 我有计划\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It's fine. Got a plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.38,0:43:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们用这个\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We will use this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.71,0:43:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-那是...? -史克鲁尔人的刑具\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Is that...? -A Skrull torture device.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.71,0:43:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 要戴在头上\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}And, wait, we put it on our heads?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.08,0:43:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,对 别怕 用它来进入记忆\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yes, it's fine. You use it to access memories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.92,0:43:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我都用它来...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I've been using it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.83,0:43:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,恢复被克里人夺走的记忆\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}to regain the memories that the Kree took from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.46,0:43:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,还在用\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Still?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.83,0:43:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.00,0:43:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,但还有不少其他用途\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}But, you know, it has a lot of other uses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.71,0:43:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,很安全\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It's safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.13,0:43:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,找个自己舒服的姿势\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You might wanna get comfortable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.22,0:43:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉好奇怪\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}This is weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.01,0:44:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 回去\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Wait. Go back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.13,0:44:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,她的手环吸收你的能量\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Her band absorbs your energy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.34,0:44:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,再改变它的方向\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}and redirects it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.18,0:44:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好像你给她力量 让她对付你\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It's like you gave her power to use against you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.26,0:44:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,卡玛拉\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Kamala?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.26,0:44:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这个呢\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}What about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.38,0:44:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那边那些座标 看得到吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}There! Those coordinates. Can you read that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.30,0:44:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,可以 麦哲伦星系\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yes. The Magellanic Galaxy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.47,0:44:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好 让你坐机长的位子\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}All right, the pilot seat's all you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.43,0:44:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你吗 莫妮卡 超可爱的\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Is that you, Monica? You're so cute!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.99,0:44:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不 等等\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}No, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.13,0:44:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,卡萝 你在干嘛\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Carol, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.13,0:44:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要我来 玛丽亚\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Why'd you ask me to come, Maria?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.59,0:44:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,妈\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.59,0:44:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,癌症复发了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}The cancer's back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.34,0:44:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你照顾呆头鹅\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}So I need you to take care of Goose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.30,0:44:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-不行 -什么意思\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-No. -What do you mean "no?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.76,0:44:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你抗癌过 会再成功的\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}No, I mean, you beat it once. You'll beat it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.63,0:44:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,卡萝\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Carol...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.80,0:44:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-我不会抱猫回去 -它不是猫\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-I'm not taking the cat. -It's not a cat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.55,0:44:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那天应该是你才对\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It should've been you that day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.26,0:45:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那场跑到飞机棚的蠢比赛\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}That stupid race to the hangar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.47,0:45:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我根本不想当惊奇队长\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I never wanted to be Captain Marvel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.30,0:45:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝博上尉很适合我\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Captain Rambeau suits me just fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.26,0:45:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,到莫妮卡回来就好\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}And it's just until Monica gets back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.43,0:45:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,她化成灰了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}She blipped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.76,0:45:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,卡萝 我不想重来一次\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Carol, I don't wanna relive this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.38,0:45:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.84,0:45:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托停止 卡萝\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Stop now, please, Carol!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.80,0:45:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,记住你为何挺身而出\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Remember why you're out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.72,0:45:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-我找一个病人 104房 -我不清楚\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-I'm looking for a patient in room 104. -I don't know. I don't know what to tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.68,0:45:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,记得回家\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}And remember to come home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.43,0:45:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你妈去世了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Your mom, she died, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.63,0:45:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}No. No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.43,0:45:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,千万别再那样\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Never do that again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.59,0:45:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不是故意的\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I'm sorry. It wasn't on purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.55,0:45:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你妈...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Wait, so your mom...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.76,0:45:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,在我化成灰烬后过世了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Passed away while I was blipped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.13,0:45:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,等我回来\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}And when I came back...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.68,0:45:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,已经没人在了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}no one was there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.26,0:45:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.68,0:46:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.84,0:46:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,她应该很棒 真遗憾\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}She seemed really cool. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.63,0:46:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,她是啊\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}She was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.34,0:46:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,她是最棒的\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}She was the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.01,0:46:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只能靠现有的资讯\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Well, we have to make do with what we know right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.97,0:46:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们知道的\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Here is what we do know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.18,0:46:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,寰宇神经瞬移网络\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}The Universal Neural Teleportation Network...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.43,0:46:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,是时空连续体中的虫洞系统\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}is a system of wormholes through the space-time continuum{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.84,0:46:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,亦即跳跃点\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}aka, jump points...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.09,0:46:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们能在不同行星系之间跳跃\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}which allows us to hop between different planetary systems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.97,0:46:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,它能延伸与重新配置太空\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Basically, it stretches and reconfigures space{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.34,0:46:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,又不破坏时空\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}without rupturing the continuum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.22,0:46:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,就像水力压裂 钻越多孔\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Like fracking, the more holes you drill...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.09,0:46:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,页岩就越不稳 然后发生地震\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}the more destabilized the shale becomes and then... earthquake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.80,0:46:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,总之 如果她继续创造跳跃点\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Bottom line, if she keeps creating these jump points...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.26,0:46:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,情况就会迅速恶化\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}it's gonna get really bad, really fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.26,0:46:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是 她想要什么\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Question is, what does she want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.59,0:46:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,塔奈星过去遭克里人占领\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Tarnax used to be occupied by the Kree, so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.84,0:46:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,也许这次攻击是警告\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}maybe the attack was a warning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.47,0:46:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,她可能攻击另一个前移居地吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}So, she could be after another former colony?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.59,0:47:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,麦哲伦星系有前克里人移居地吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Is there a former Kree colony in the Magellanic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.38,0:47:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,克里人曾经遍及四分之一的银河系\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}At one point the Kree colonized 25% of the galaxy, so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.55,0:47:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,如果她只想摧毁塔奈星\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}If all she wanted was to destroy Tarnax...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.55,0:47:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,为何不发动军队或用炸弹\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}why not bring in an army or use a bomb or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.20,0:47:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,为何用跳跃点\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Why a jump point?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.50,0:47:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,对 跳跃点不是武器 而是运输工具\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You're right. Jump points aren't weapons, they're means of transportation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.68,0:47:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,每个跳跃点都有两面\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Every jump point has two sides...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.55,0:47:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,如果塔奈星的大气被吸走\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}so if Tarnax's atmosphere was siphoned away...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.34,0:47:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-一定会去某个地方 -哈拉星\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-it had to go somewhere, or... -Hala.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.72,0:47:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,克里内战\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}The Kree Civil War...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.43,0:47:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,造成哈拉星的天然资源枯竭\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}basically bankrupted Hala of its natural resources.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.55,0:47:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,空气几乎不适合呼吸\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}The air is barely breathable...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.97,0:47:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-他们饱受干旱之苦 -干旱?\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-they're suffering from a drought. -A drought?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.88,0:47:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那她接下来可能要找水\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}So, she could be after water next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.09,0:47:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好 麦哲伦星系哪里有\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Okay. Where in the Magellanic can we find...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.76,0:47:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,阿拉丹拿星\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Aladna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.63,0:47:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,表面99.63%是海洋\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Oceans cover 99.63% of the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.09,0:47:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好精确的数字 你去过\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}That is a very specific stat. You've been there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.13,0:47:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.05,0:47:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.76,0:47:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,她口气怪怪的\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}She said that really weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.26,0:47:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-你怎么怪怪的 -好\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Yeah. Why are you being weird? -Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.38,0:47:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我们同意去阿拉丹拿星\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Consensus on Aladna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.38,0:47:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-是 -我们就去吧\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Aye. -Yeah, I say we do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.13,0:48:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,去阿拉丹拿星 抢走达本的手镯\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Get to Aladna and separate Dar-Benn from that bangle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.09,0:48:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,目的地有了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We have our heading.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.76,0:48:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,卡玛拉 你不准参加太空冒险\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Kamala, you are not going on any space adventures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.38,0:48:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克告诉我它们有多危险\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Nicholas has told me how dangerous they can be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.22,0:48:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,叫他福瑞啦 天啊\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It's just "Fury." God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.09,0:48:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在哪 爸呢\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Wait. Where are you guys? Where is Abu?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.01,0:48:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,在地狱 这个人带我们到地狱\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Hell. This man has taken us to Hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.77,0:48:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,地狱 所以我是魔鬼啰\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Hell? So that means I'm the devil?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.85,0:48:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-真的吗 福瑞 -他们坚持\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Really, Fury? -They insisted,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.64,0:48:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,而且你爸不太适应太空旅行\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}and your dad is not adjusting very well to space travel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.39,0:48:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝 我搭疯狂太空电梯往上升\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Hey, babe, so I'm in this crazy space elevator and we're going up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.23,0:48:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,或者往下坠\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Or maybe we're going down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.68,0:48:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-太空里有方向吗 -有\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Are there directions in space? -Yes, there are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.10,0:48:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不准拍摄\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}But no filming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.45,0:48:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Oh. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.98,0:48:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,帮帮我\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.02,0:48:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,福瑞 情况还好吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Fury, everything okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.14,0:48:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,又碰到一个突波\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We've had another surge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.43,0:49:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,整个网络上都有通报\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Reports are coming in across the network.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.52,0:49:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好像大家都受到影响\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It seems everyone's been affected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.31,0:49:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得阻止她再创造跳跃点\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Well, we need to stop her from making another one...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.02,0:49:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,同时也不能冒险在银河中交换位置\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}and we can't risk intergalactic body swapping in the meantime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.98,0:49:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,克汗太太 你女儿必须留在我船上\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Mrs. Khan, I'm sorry, but your daughter will have to stay aboard my ship...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.27,0:49:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-直到我们查出原因 -不行\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-until we can get to the bottom of this. -Oh, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.02,0:49:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,赞啦\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.02,0:49:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要放她走\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You will let her go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.43,0:49:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,克汗太太 没那么简单\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Mrs. Khan, it is not that simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.77,0:49:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要卡玛拉\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We need Kamala.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.23,0:49:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,妈 我们发现外婆的另一只手镯\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Ammi, we found Nani's other bangle...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.81,0:49:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,有个奇怪又吓人的美女\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}and there's this weirdly beautiful but kind of terrifying woman...{\r}
