Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.02,0:49:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,继续进行\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Stay the course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.35,0:49:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们想办法关闭那些跳跃点\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We'll figure out how to close those jump points.{\r}
