Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.64,0:50:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,惊奇教授\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Professor Marvel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.10,0:50:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,新星 超新星女\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Nova, Supernova Girl...{\r}
