Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.85,0:51:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我会了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Hey, I got this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.27,0:51:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.35,0:51:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,交换\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}And switch!{\r}
