Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.78,0:55:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,跳舞是生命\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Dancing is life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.19,0:55:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,快到了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Oh, we're almost there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.61,0:55:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好漂亮 嗨 好\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}How angelic. Hi... Okay. All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.36,0:55:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.40,0:55:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他们嗑了什么 给我来一点\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Oh, my gosh, give me some of what they're having.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.73,0:55:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-你们要是告诉别人 -什么\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-If you tell anyone about... -What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.69,0:55:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,说你是妖娇美丽的王妃\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}That you're a pretty, pretty princess?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.53,0:55:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,原来这就是你说的"法律问题"\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}So, that's what you meant when you said "legal issue."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.11,0:55:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这是各取所需的婚姻 就像外交措施\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It is a marriage of convenience. It's more of a diplomatic act, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.32,0:55:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,母系社会的权力斗争\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It's like, there was a power struggle. Matriarchal society.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.15,0:55:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是朋友 说来话长\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We are friends. It's a long story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.44,0:55:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你能唱出来\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Maybe you could sing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.48,0:56:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,才不要\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Maybe not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.40,0:56:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.64,0:56:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Damn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.35,0:56:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-你看见他们抵达 -你好\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-You saw them arrive -Oh, hello{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.39,0:56:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你为何爱来这里了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Well, okay, I see why you like to come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.06,0:56:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-注意 -是\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Attention -Yes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.39,0:56:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴向在场所有人宣布\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}A pleasure to announce To this lovely roomful{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.68,0:56:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,两张新面孔\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Two new faces{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.10,0:56:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,一张可以再开心点\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}One could be more cheerful{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.18,0:56:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,哈 哈 哈\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Ha-Ha-Ha-Ha-Ha-Ha{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.60,0:56:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 我们摇摇铃\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}But nonetheless, we ring the bells{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.81,0:56:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎哪位来说明\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}To usher in, who, pray tell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.39,0:56:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}None other than{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.81,0:56:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,一 二 三\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}One, two, three{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.80,0:56:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,惊奇天团\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}The Marvels!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.43,0:57:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-惊奇天团 -惊奇天团\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-The Marvels -The Marvels?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.56,0:57:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,赞\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.93,0:57:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么已经定名了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}How is that even a thing already?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.60,0:57:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-好 镇定一点 -王子呢\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Okay, let's be cool. -Where's the prince?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.56,0:57:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}That's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.60,0:57:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么搞的\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.93,0:57:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-她在干嘛 -入境随俗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-What is she doing? -She's respecting the flow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.68,0:57:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这一次\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}How long{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.23,0:57:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,能与舞伴共度多久\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}do I have with my dance partner this time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.93,0:57:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,阳\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yan...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.52,0:57:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们都有... -怎么回事\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-we are all... -What is happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.06,0:57:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-危险 -什么\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-in danger -What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.56,0:57:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-队长需要我们帮助 -帮助\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-The Captain needs our help -Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.27,0:57:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,达本来了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Dar-Benn is coming{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.77,0:57:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在心情好复杂\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I'm feeling so many feelings right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.14,0:57:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,阿拉丹拿不怕她\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Oh, Aladna's not afraid of her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.14,0:57:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,邀她下来 让她踏上土地\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Invite her down put her feet on the ground{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.18,0:58:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,给我一个机会\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Give me a chance here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.60,0:58:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-以免不可收拾 -引狼入室\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-before it gets too messy -So lead the wolf inside our walls{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.18,0:58:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,相信靠你一个人\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}And trust that you alone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.27,0:58:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-就能阻止大军 -我可曾让你失望\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-can stop an army? -Have I ever let you down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.93,0:58:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你的粉丝小说能写几章\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}How many chapters of your Captain Marvel fan fiction is this giving you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.45,0:58:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-好多章 -别忘记\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-So many. -and don't forget...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.52,0:58:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,别忘记\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Don't forget{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.89,0:58:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我不孤单\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I'm not alone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.64,0:58:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,莫妮卡\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Monica.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.77,0:58:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我来自星星的王妃\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}My Princess from the star...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.64,0:58:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 停 我们需要谈谈\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Sorry. Sorry. Sorry. Stop. Please stop. We need to talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.73,0:58:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-好 我们来谈 -好\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Okay, let's talk. -Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.18,0:58:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 他不必唱歌吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Oh, wait. He doesn't have to sing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.23,0:58:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,对 他会双语\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yeah, he's bilingual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.77,0:58:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们穿着非常不得体\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We are severely underdressed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.27,0:58:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,能帮我们找战斗服吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}But could you get us something a little more battle-ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.27,0:58:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.93,0:58:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.85,0:58:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,目前的推论\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Theories so far?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.39,0:58:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,最佳状况是一次性的害虫问题\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}At best, a one-off pest problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.60,0:59:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,最糟的可能是敌人放置的\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}At worst, an enemy plant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.27,0:59:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,某种感染性生物武器\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Some kinda infestation bioweapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.60,0:59:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,也可能是内贼所为\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Or it could be from a traitor from within.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.10,0:59:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,先别往那边想 你说的这个卵\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Well, let's not go there yet. This... egg you say...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.89,0:59:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,继续研究 如果发现什么\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}let's just continue to study it, and if anything...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.48,0:59:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,警告 侦测到29个新物体\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Warning. Twenty-nine new objects detected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.10,0:59:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.40,0:59:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,(发现个数  30)
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.06,0:59:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,光女士怎么样\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}What about Lady of Light?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.60,0:59:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-频率 脉冲星 -不要 不要\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Frequency. Pulsar. -No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.43,0:59:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,脉冲星光女士\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Pulsar Light Lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.85,0:59:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不行 这服装太扯了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Absolutely not. These... These are too much, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.31,0:59:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-当然 -哪会\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Definitely. -No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.56,0:59:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,速战速决 别太浮夸\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We make this quick. Nothing grandiose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.73,0:59:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,三位必须消失 但别跑远\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You three need to disappear. But stay close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.43,0:59:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我的强项\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}My specialty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.60,0:59:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,会成功的 阳\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}This will work, Yan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.85,1:00:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,记住 尽量别无意中交换位置\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Remember, we wanna keep unintentional switching to a minimum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.10,1:00:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,尽量拖住她\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Entertain her as long as you possibly can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.43,1:00:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,莫妮卡和我会突袭她\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Monica and I will get the jump on her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.18,1:00:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会抢到手镯\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}And we'll get the bangle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.81,1:00:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,时间到了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It's time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.48,1:01:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,至高者 你怎么来了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Supremor, why have you come?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.68,1:01:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我来赦免你反抗克里帝国的罪\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I've come here to pardon you for your crimes against the Kree Empire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.10,1:01:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,跪下\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Kneel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.52,1:01:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,向你跪?\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}To you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.73,1:01:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-我绝对不跪 -好\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-I will never kneel. -Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.39,1:02:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.02,1:02:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,用你的围巾\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Use your scarf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.35,1:02:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.43,1:02:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,找到她了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I found her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.31,1:03:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,莫妮卡 你在哪里\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Monica, where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.27,1:03:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,莫妮卡 跟我交换\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Monica, tag me in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.39,1:03:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,一 二\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}One, two...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.85,1:03:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,别这么做\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Don't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.02,1:03:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你来不及了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You're too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.57,1:04:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你在哪里拿到的\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Where did you get that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.44,1:04:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我外婆 她寄给我的\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}My grandma, she sent it to me in the mail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.53,1:04:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-给我 -卡玛拉 快跑\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Give it to me. -Kamala, run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.28,1:04:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,上船\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Get to the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.53,1:04:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有了它 你的力量只会使我更强大\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}With this, your powers only make me stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.00,1:04:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,突波破坏了我们的系统\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}The surges are frying our systems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.69,1:04:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要处理这些吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Are we doing something about these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.98,1:05:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,太空电梯断线了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}The space elevator's offline.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.28,1:05:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你都没有好消息吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You ever come in here with good news?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.07,1:05:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,半数逃生舱故障了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Half the evacuation pods just went down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.90,1:05:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是好消息\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}That's not good news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.85,1:05:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你们上船了吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Are you guys in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.06,1:05:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,上了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}In.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.85,1:05:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,全体战斗机改向\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Redirect all fighters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.89,1:05:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,解除自动驾驶\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Disengaging autopilot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.48,1:06:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 起飞\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Oh, my God. Okay, here we go. Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.64,1:06:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,莫妮卡\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Monica?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.81,1:06:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,莫妮卡 往下坠了 莫妮卡\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Monica, we're going down, Monica!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.02,1:06:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你会开\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I thought you could drive this thing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.48,1:06:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,卡萝 快下来\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Carol! Get down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.02,1:06:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,别急\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Hold that thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.18,1:06:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这小姐太扯了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Can you believe this woman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.11,1:06:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,队长 我的队长\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}O, Captain! My Captain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.86,1:06:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-不 -走开\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-No, no, no! -Move over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.30,1:06:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我来启动跳跃点\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I'm activating a jump point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.70,1:06:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-不 我能甩掉她 -另外20艘呢\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-No, I can lose her. -And what about the other 20 ships?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.40,1:06:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我有办法\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I can do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.50,1:07:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-导弹锁定 -姐姐\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Missile lock. -Guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.15,1:07:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,导弹锁定\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Missile lock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.36,1:07:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,导弹来袭\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Incoming missiles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.11,1:07:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-击中倒数 五 -该离开了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Impact in five... -We need to leave now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.86,1:07:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-我不能让旧事重演 -四\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-I can't let this happen again. -four...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.03,1:07:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-已经重演了 -三 二\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-It already has. -three, two...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.94,1:07:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-我做得到 -你会害死我们\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-I can do this. -And you'll kill us trying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.44,1:07:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,跳跃点启动\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Jump point activated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.11,1:07:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们丢下阿拉丹拿星自生自灭\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We left Aladna to fend for themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.15,1:07:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,达本要抢我的手镯\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Dar-Benn was gonna get my bangle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.69,1:07:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我做出困难决定 跟你在塔奈星一样\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}So I made a tough call like you did on Tarnax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.88,1:07:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,别学我 我整个搞砸了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Don't try to be like me. I messed this whole thing up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.00,1:07:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们没缠结在一起\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}If we weren't entangled...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.48,1:08:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们不在这里 你就能击败达本\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}if we weren't here, then you could have beat Dar-Benn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.32,1:08:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}And I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.65,1:08:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你不懂\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}No, you don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.15,1:08:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,克里人已被人工智能统治一千年\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}The Kree had been ruled by an AI for a millennia...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.73,1:08:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,造成他们陷入战争\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}that led them into a war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.32,1:08:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为要阻止它 只有摧毁它\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}And I thought the only way to stop it was to destroy it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.61,1:08:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,可是我却...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}But I just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.53,1:08:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,越帮越忙\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}made it worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.40,1:08:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我是他们内战开打的原因\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I'm the reason why the civil war started in the first place...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.07,1:08:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我害他们无法呼吸空气\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I'm the reason why they couldn't breathe the air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.53,1:08:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我才得到歼灭者的称号\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}That's how I got the name Annihilator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.23,1:08:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我不要你们看到我的那一面\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}And I never wanted you to see that version of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.82,1:08:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你才没回来过\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Is that why you never came back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.15,1:08:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我想如果将功赎罪\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I thought if I fixed it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.28,1:08:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我就能回家\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}then I could come home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.82,1:08:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,卡萝\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Carol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.90,1:08:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,家人不是那样子\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}That's not how family works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.57,1:08:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我根本不期望你当无敌的惊奇队长\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I never expected you to be the mighty Captain Marvel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.15,1:08:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我只要你\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I just wanted you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.23,1:09:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我的阿姨\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}My aunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.48,1:09:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好高兴你在这里\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I'm really glad that you're here now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.19,1:09:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,还有你\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}And you, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.61,1:09:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我很高兴能在这里\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I'm glad to be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.23,1:09:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,希望看得出来 我也很抱歉\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I hope that goes without saying. And I am sorry...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.90,1:09:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,刚开始热情过头\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}for coming on too strong at the beginning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.32,1:09:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我没给你太多空间做自己\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I did not give you a lot of space to be a real person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.57,1:09:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得找到她\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We have to find her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.90,1:09:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,她可能在任何地方\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I mean, but she could be anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.61,1:09:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不是任何地方\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}No, not anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.28,1:09:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,她会锁定我关心的人\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}She's targeting the people that I care about...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.28,1:09:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,抢走我每个家园的资源\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}and stealing resources from every place I call home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.78,1:09:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须警告福瑞\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We have to warn Fury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.11,1:09:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这是紧急状况\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}This is an emergency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.90,1:10:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,神刃太空站全员立刻至逃生舱报到\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}All S.A.B.E.R. personnel must report to an evacuation pod immediately. Walk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.90,1:10:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-别跑 -只有一个逃生站正常运作\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Do not run. -We only have one evacuation bay online.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.07,1:10:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,所以15艘逃生舱\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Which means that all we have left...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.32,1:10:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,却得撤离350人\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}to evacuate 350 personnel are 15 escape pods...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.86,1:10:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,每艘硬挤能载10人 根本不够\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}which seat five, 10, if we squeeze. It's nowhere near enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.19,1:10:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的逃生舱尽量塞人\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Well, fill the remaining ones with as many people as you can...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.82,1:10:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-再想备案 -这是紧急状况...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-then come up with a Plan B. -This is an emergency. All S.A.B.E.R...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.86,1:10:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不 等等\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.40,1:10:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,阿米尔 去帮他们\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Aamir. Go help them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.48,1:10:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Okay, okay. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.90,1:10:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,让我来\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.11,1:10:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我的客厅\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}My living room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.11,1:10:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,呆头鹅\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Goose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.61,1:10:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,呆头鹅 你怎么...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Goose, how'd you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.73,1:10:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,过来 快点\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Come here. Come. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.57,1:11:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,对 过来 看看你\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yes. Yes. Come here. Look at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.28,1:11:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.78,1:11:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,别弄我的眼睛\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Oh, no, not my good eye!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.90,1:11:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只剩一艘逃生舱\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We only have one escape pod left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.19,1:11:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,完蛋了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We're doomed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.65,1:11:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,到最后...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}In the end...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.32,1:11:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都不能选择如何从这一世\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}none of us choose how we transition from this life...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.28,1:11:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,转移到下一世\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}to the next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.03,1:11:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 不\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}What? No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.90,1:11:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,叫所有人到逃生站\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Get everyone to the evacuation deck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.03,1:11:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.40,1:11:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这是在干嘛\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}What are we doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.48,1:11:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-我没办法 你能吗 -我来\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-I can't. Can you? -I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.53,1:11:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 亲爱的家人\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}What is going on, fam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.78,1:11:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,卡玛拉\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Kamala?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.36,1:11:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,卡玛拉 优素福 是卡玛拉\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Kamala! Yusuf, Kamala!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.15,1:11:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,卡玛拉\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Kamala! Kamala!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.48,1:11:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你平安回来了 宝贝\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You're back safely, beta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.98,1:11:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-嗨 -你没死\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You're not dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.40,1:11:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟地球失联\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I've lost contact with Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.32,1:12:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正式进入弃船阶段\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We're officially at abandon-ship phase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.03,1:12:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,吐出来\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Spit him out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.19,1:12:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-吐出来 -不\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Spit him out. -No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.69,1:12:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不 这是我的计划\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}No. That's the plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.40,1:12:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这是计划?\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}That's the plan? {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.60,1:12:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,运送一个猫咪家族比几百人简单\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}to transport a family of cats than hundreds of crew members.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.94,1:12:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们真的要移猫\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}So, we're literally herding cats?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.98,1:12:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,过来 猫咪\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Come here, kitty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.28,1:12:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,神刃太空站人员注意\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Attention, S.A.B.E.R. crew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.15,1:12:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,别跑 让佛莱肯吃掉你\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Stop running and let the Flerkens eat you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.23,1:12:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会有事的\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You will be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.48,1:12:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,神刃太空站人员\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}S.A.B.E.R. crew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.03,1:12:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,别跑 让佛莱肯吃掉你\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Stop running and let the Flerkens eat you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.15,1:12:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,别跑\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Stop running.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.11,1:13:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.48,1:13:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,别跑 让佛莱肯吃掉你\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Stop running and let the Flerkens eat you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.57,1:13:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,别跑\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Stop running.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.65,1:13:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,(侦测到输入)
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.70,1:13:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,(星图)
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.32,1:13:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我找到她了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Guys, I found her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.15,1:13:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-快点 快走 -来\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Come on. Come on, move. -Hey! Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.44,1:13:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Come on, come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.23,1:13:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-快去 -快\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Go, go, go. -Come on, come on.{\r}
