Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.86,1:13:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,优素福 别用腰带\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Come on. Yusuf, stop with your belt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.11,1:14:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 谢谢\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Nope. No. No, no, no. Thank you. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.86,1:14:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Come, come, come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.98,1:14:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,放心 小猫 去找卡玛拉\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Don't you worry, little one. Here, go to Kamala. Go to Kamala.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.65,1:14:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-过来 -我发现达本了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-There you go, come, come. -I found Dar-Benn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.07,1:14:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.86,1:14:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,她要我们的太阳\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}She wants our sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.82,1:14:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你又要离开了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You leavin' again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.61,1:14:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.23,1:15:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,宇宙还是不安全\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Ammi, the universe isn't safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.94,1:15:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,如果宇宙不安全 你们就不安全\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}And if the universe isn't safe, that means you guys aren't safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.11,1:15:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们不...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}And if you guys aren't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.90,1:15:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.94,1:15:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你肩负着更重大的使命\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You are chosen for a greater purpose, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.78,1:15:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你当然该走了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}So, of course you must go now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.94,1:15:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但我永远不会放开你\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}But I will never let you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.15,1:15:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂吧\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You understand that, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.20,1:15:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,平安归来 女儿\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Come back safely, beta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.57,1:15:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,最好回来 我不想当独生子\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You better. I don't wanna be an only child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.53,1:15:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不要又自己应付这两个\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Not again. Not with these two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.19,1:15:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,带着手镯去找那坏蛋好吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You think it's wise taking that bangle to the bad guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.32,1:15:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,福瑞先生说得对 给我 我带回家\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yes. Mr. Fury's right. Give it to me. I will take it home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.57,1:15:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,达本开启了另一个跳跃点\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Dar-Benn's opened another jump point...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.94,1:15:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,需要两只手镯才能关闭它\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}and we're gonna need both bangles to close it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.15,1:15:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那你最好别让她抢走\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Then I guess you'd better make damn sure she doesn't get her hands on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.11,1:15:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,了解\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Understood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.65,1:16:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 福瑞先生\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Oh, God, Mr. Fury...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.94,1:16:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-你飞错方向了 -克汗太太 我知道\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-you are going in the wrong direction! -Mrs. Khan, I know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.48,1:16:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-成功了 福瑞先生 -我什么都没做\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-You did it, Mr. Fury! -I didn't do anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.98,1:16:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你在祷告吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Are you praying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.03,1:16:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,别停 我们需要众神帮忙\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Don't stop! We need all the help we can get!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.48,1:16:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,阿门\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Amen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.53,1:16:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,阿门\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Amen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.94,1:16:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我的妈呀\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Holy cow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.28,1:16:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,福瑞先生\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Mr. Fury!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.07,1:17:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,她来了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}There she is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.28,1:17:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,歼灭者本尊\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}the Annihilator herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.07,1:17:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,结束了 达本\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It's over, Dar-Benn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.90,1:17:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,还没\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}No, not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.23,1:17:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你会不顾一切保护哈拉星\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I know that you would do anything to protect Hala.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.44,1:17:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这将是克里人的末日 一切的末日\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}This will be the end of the Kree. It will be the end of everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.99,1:17:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你夺走我的一切 我只是以牙还牙\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You took from me. I'm simply repaying the favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.11,1:17:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,来 手环交给我\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Now, give me the band.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.40,1:17:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你忘了一样东西\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You're forgetting something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.73,1:17:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么 -我\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-What? -Me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.20,1:18:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,本来可以很轻松解决的\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}This could have been so much easier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.83,1:18:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不好说 我们的胜率比较高\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I don't know. I like our odds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.08,1:19:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你又恢复恶名了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You're living up to your name again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.49,1:19:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不想这样\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I didn't want this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.03,1:19:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡似乎紧跟着你\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Death seems to follow you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.95,1:19:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,其实不必落得这种下场 达本\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It doesn't have to end like this, Dar-Benn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.78,1:19:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托把手镯给我们\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Please, just give us the bangle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.12,1:19:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,做梦\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I won't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.08,1:19:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,哈拉星的太阳因你而亡\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Hala's sun died because of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.58,1:19:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你凭什么不必付出代价\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Why shouldn't you repay us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.33,1:20:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,也许她应该\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Maybe she should.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.24,1:20:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你们太阳核心的反应减缓了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}The reaction in your sun's core has slowed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.03,1:20:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,它需要极大能量才能重启\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It needs an incredible amount of energy to jump-start it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.49,1:20:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你有办法 卡萝\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}and that's what you have, Carol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.20,1:20:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你能用你的力量拯救哈拉星\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You can use your powers to save Hala.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.58,1:20:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,但我没做过那种事\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}But I've never done anything like that before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.70,1:20:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这几天我做了许多没做过的事\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}In the last couple of days I have done a lot of things I have never done before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.41,1:20:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以的\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.33,1:20:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,为了哈拉星\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}For Hala.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.28,1:20:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,为了哈拉星\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}For Hala.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.20,1:20:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,敢轻举妄动 我马上杀了她\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Try anything and I'll kill her faster than you can move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.95,1:21:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,卡萝\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Carol!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.53,1:21:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.70,1:21:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你会没办法存活\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You won't survive this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.16,1:21:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,达本 听我说\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Dar-Benn, listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.00,1:22:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.46,1:22:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,还好\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.92,1:22:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我没交换位置\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I didn't switch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.88,1:22:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,一 二 三\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}One, two, three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.58,1:22:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我好高兴你没事\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I'm so glad you're okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.46,1:22:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你抢到手镯了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You got the bangles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.00,1:22:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会用得上\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We are gonna need those.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.33,1:22:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,起来吧 王妃\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Okay, come on, Princess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.13,1:23:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在看什么\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}So, what are we looking at?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.13,1:23:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,一个自我传播奇异点 具有负质量\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}A self-propagating singularity with negative mass...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.08,1:23:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,与非典型物理特性\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}and non-Newtonian topology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.50,1:23:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,她在时空中扯开一个洞\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}She tore a hole in space-time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.08,1:23:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那是个不同的现实 逐渐扩张过来\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}That is a different reality bleeding into ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.96,1:23:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能解决吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Can we even fix that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.29,1:23:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,理论上 你和卡萝能复制\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}In theory, you and Carol can reproduce the same amount of energy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.75,1:23:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,用来打开它的能量\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}that was used to open it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.33,1:23:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我吸收再释放它 但从洞里进行\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I will absorb it and then release it, but from inside the tear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.29,1:23:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,但交换位置怎么了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}But what about the switching?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.00,1:23:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的超能力不再缠结了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Our powers aren't entangled anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.96,1:23:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我想那是好事\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Well, that's a good thing, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.83,1:23:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你要我们用在时空结构中\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}But, wait. You want us to blast you with the same amount of power...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.00,1:23:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,砸出一个洞的能量轰击你\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}that punched a hole in the fabric of space-time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.46,1:23:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,如果要把它补起来 没错\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}If we wanna un-punch it, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.96,1:23:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,莫妮卡\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Monica...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.63,1:23:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你会需要这个\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You're gonna need this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.29,1:24:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉如何 惊奇少女\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}How are you feeling, Ms. Marvel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.04,1:24:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这些手镯穿越了时空\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}These bangles traveled through space and time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.79,1:24:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,找到我\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}To find me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.25,1:24:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我天生就该做这件事\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I was born for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.71,1:24:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,必须立刻开始\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It has to be now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.88,1:25:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你妈一定会很骄傲\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Your mom would be proud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.34,1:25:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,更高 更远 更快\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Higher, further, faster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.22,1:25:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,更高 更远 更快\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Higher, further, faster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.00,1:26:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,它在闭合了 莫妮卡 快离开\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It's closing, Monica. You've got to get out of there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.64,1:26:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能离开 卡萝\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I can't leave, Carol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.10,1:26:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}What? What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.45,1:26:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能离开\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I can't leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.81,1:26:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我得完成任务\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I have to finish the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.18,1:26:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不 莫妮卡 它合起来了 你会困住\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}No! Monica, it's closing. You'll be trapped!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.68,1:26:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.48,1:26:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,快啊\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.40,1:26:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我始终明白我得留下\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Always knew I would have to stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.43,1:27:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,卡玛拉\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Kamala.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.70,1:28:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,卡玛拉 你拯救了世界\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Kamala, you saved the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.89,1:28:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么哭了 你怎么哭了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Why are you crying? Why are you crying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.43,1:28:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.93,1:28:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我们失去了莫妮卡\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We lost Monica.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.73,1:28:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,她困在另一边\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}She got stuck on the other side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.73,1:28:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,卡萝呢\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}And Carol?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.40,1:28:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,她去实现一个承诺\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}She went to fulfill a promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.45,1:28:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,(哈拉星)
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.85,1:30:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,情况如何\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}How are things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.40,1:30:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那些星球预计能完全恢复\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}The planets are expected to make a full recovery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.45,1:30:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有一组科学家被派去协助哈拉星\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}And a team of scientists are being sent to Hala to try and help their people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.39,1:30:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我指的不是这个\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}That's not what I meant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.23,1:30:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,(路易斯安那州)
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.05,1:30:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,(呆头鹅的零食)
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.31,1:30:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这边写"厨房" 但都是辣酱包\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}This says "Kitchen," but there are all these hot sauce packets...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.73,1:30:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一个很诡异的托盘\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}And then there's this very bizarre-looking tray...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.02,1:30:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不过看起来质量很好\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}which I will say is a very good quality, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.10,1:30:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以留着\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You can keep it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.15,1:30:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-不 卡萝 -还能去哪\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Oh, no, no, Carol, I just... -Where else would they go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.55,1:30:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是不懂这怎么在箱子里...\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I just don't understand how it's in the box...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.95,1:30:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我的\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Oh, yeah, yeah, it was for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.14,1:30:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,太空之大刷新了我的三观\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}The vastness of it just gives you a whole new perspective on life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.39,1:30:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,就是说啊\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yeah, it does, doesn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.48,1:30:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,而且冷到爆\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}And it was surprisingly cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.10,1:30:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这里棒呆了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}This place is amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.81,1:31:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yeah, it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.02,1:31:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你还会开那架吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Hey, do you still fly that thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.10,1:31:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-想去看看吗 -想\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-You wanna check it out? -I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.43,1:31:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.56,1:31:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 过来\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Hey, wait, wait, wait. Come here. Come here. Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.64,1:31:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-我好开心你平安回家 -好啦\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-I'm so happy that you're home safe, beta. -Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.98,1:31:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,阿米尔\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Aamir...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.98,1:31:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这间房子很适合成家\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}this would be a lovely house to raise a family in, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.43,1:31:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,阿米尔\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Aamir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.73,1:31:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,实在太酷了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}This is so cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.85,1:31:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,让你坐机长的位子\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Pilot seat's all you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.80,1:31:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们起飞吧\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Let's fly this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.68,1:31:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我没钥匙\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I actually don't have the key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.81,1:31:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我只负责保管\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I'm just looking after it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.56,1:31:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,直到莫妮卡回来\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Just until Monica gets back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.10,1:31:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.73,1:31:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,直到莫妮卡回来\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Just until Monica gets back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.39,1:31:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我好想她\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I really miss her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.43,1:32:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们合作无间\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We were good together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.68,1:32:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这让我想到\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Which got me thinking...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.68,1:32:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,披萨送来了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Pizza delivery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.48,1:32:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.39,1:32:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么事吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Can I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.05,1:32:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,凯特·毕夏普\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Kate Bishop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.81,1:32:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为你是世上唯一的超级英雄吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Did you think you're the only kid superhero in the world?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.64,1:32:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-我23岁 -我知道\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Well, I'm 23. -Oh, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.40,1:32:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,(神刃太空站)
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.27,1:32:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我在看你的资料\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I've been reading up on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.52,1:32:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那是哪来的\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Where did you get that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.68,1:32:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,在我沙发上发现的\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I found it in my couch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.43,1:32:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.52,1:32:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚成为一个更庞大宇宙的一员\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You've just become part of a much larger universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.06,1:32:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,目前主要只有我一个\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Which, at the moment, is just me, mostly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.93,1:32:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,但我有征询过别人\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I do have feelers out, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.10,1:32:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-知道蚁人有女儿吗 -你想干嘛\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Did you know Ant-Man had a daughter? -What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.10,1:33:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我要组成一个团队\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I'm putting together a team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.39,1:33:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你加入\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}And I want you on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.71,1:33:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托啦\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.00,1:35:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,《惊奇队长2》
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.70,1:36:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,妈\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.19,1:36:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,妈\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}"Mom"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.19,1:36:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-妈  -"妈?"\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-Mom! -"Mom?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.19,1:36:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我好想你\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I've missed you so much!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.32,1:36:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你想我?\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You missed me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.53,1:36:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-对不起 -好 好 好\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}-I'm so sorry. I'm... -Okay. Okay. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.23,1:36:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我 没关系 你没事\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Hey, hey, look at me. It's okay. You're okay. Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.69,1:36:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的神秘访客还好吗\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}How's our mysterious visitor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.88,1:36:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,她好像有点头脑不清\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}She seems a little disoriented.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.25,1:36:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这是哪里 怎么回事\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Where... Where are we? What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.22,1:36:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还希望你能告诉我们\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}We were hoping you could tell us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.15,1:36:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只知道双星发现了你\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}All we know is that Binary found you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.65,1:36:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜你通过时空中的裂缝\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}My theory? You somehow crossed through a tear in space-time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.07,1:36:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你在你那个世界的平行现实里\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}You are now in a reality parallel to your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.53,1:37:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 那是不可能的\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Which is, of course, impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.94,1:37:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我想现在状况可能有点混淆\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I think there might be a little confusion happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.57,1:37:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,混淆只是踏上知识之路的第一步\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Confusion is but the first step on the journey to knowledge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.90,1:37:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好 由我来接手\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Okay. I'll take it from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.69,1:37:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,查尔斯要求报告最新状况\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Charles asked for an update.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.32,1:37:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我晚点再过来看你\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}I'll come by and check on you later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.28,1:37:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.94,1:37:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fs14\1c&H41A9C2&}Oh, shit.{\r}

